{"id":"n71284-1-7","stage":2,"title":"쏟아지다 · 泼出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71284-1-7-1","ko":"갑자기 밀면 어떻게 해! 커피가 다 쏟아졌잖아.","zh":"怎么突然推我！咖啡全洒了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"밀면","meaning":"推","explanation":"밀다：推；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"밀다","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74177","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밀면","audio":"/audio/9bd8c1eb2f1c2802ebf3.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"해!","meaning":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","explanation":"하다：给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"24","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"커피가","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피가","audio":"/audio/841acaba8cdda81d3281.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":